    "summary": "Wi-Fi 6 (802.11ax) and Wi-Fi 6E offer significant improvements in speed, latency, and device capacity over previous standards, making them worthwhile upgrades especially for congested environments and multi-device households, though the benefit depends heavily on device compatibility and internet plan speeds.",
